    "ev-616be7148a2c",
    "ev-c0a0cf40a875"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "ruled_out": [
  {
   "statement": "Gateway as origin: it only relays orders' 504 as 502 and was not redeployed.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-cabcf49a9d1c",
    "ev-c8dd0e54519d"
   ]
  },
  {
   "statement": "Orders as origin: its errors are timeouts waiting on inventory, and trace self time is concentrated in inventory, not orders.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-598e61f136b1",
    "ev-c8dd0e54519d"
   ]
  },
  {
   "statement": "Traffic surge: request rate stayed around 2 req/s at the gateway throughout.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-616be7148a2c"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "unknowns": [
  "Which code or config change in inventory 3.3.0 slowed /reserve (e.g., locking, DB query, external call) is not shown in the evidence.",
  "Whether 3.3.1 was an intentional fix or rollback for this issue, and whether it fully resolves it, is not confirmed. Recovery timing coincides with the deploy.",
  "Inventory logs are absent from the snapshot, so the internal cause of slowness is unobserved."
 ],
 "recommended_actions": [
